**THIS RESOURCE-PACK CONTAINS PROFANITY IN SOME OF ITS SOUND EFFECTS AND IS INTENDED FOR HUMOROUS PURPOSES.**

**ALL VOICE RECORDINGS AND IMAGES USED IN THIS RESOURCE-PACK ARE INCLUDED WITH THE PERMISSION OF THEIR OWNER.**

**THIS RESOURCE-PACK WAS CREATED FOR A LOCAL COMMUNITY AND IS NOT INTENDED TO OFFEND ANYONE. IT IS A JOKE RESOURCE PACK.**

This resource pack replaces the Ghast's texture and all of its sounds with VaneaVime. Specifically, it replaces:

* the entire Ghast model with VaneaVime;
* all Ghast sounds with VaneaVime;
* the Ghast Spawn Egg texture with VaneaVime;
* and renames the Ghast Spawn Egg to **"VaneaVime Spawn Egg."**

I hope you enjoy this resource-pack!
